Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,导演：朗·霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.18,0:00:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,字幕翻译制作：goodliuwu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,梅尔·吉布森
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.47,0:00:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,蕾妮·罗素
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnSimHei\fs20\1c&H301EE6&}赎  金
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.41,0:01:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好了，大伙，我找到他的广告了 快进来\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Okay everyone, I found his commercial. Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.11,0:01:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，我等不及要看了\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Oh, I can't wait to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.20,0:01:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这回他躲不掉了，我们要播放\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Oh, he...he can't weasel out of this one. We're gonna show it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.08,0:01:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,表演时间到，乡亲们，快点\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}It's show time, folks. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.17,0:01:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘘  - 安静\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Shh! Shh! Shh! - Hey, quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.97,0:01:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我来自纽约州北部社会底层…\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I came from fairly humble beginnings from upstate New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.35,0:01:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老实说，我以前从没上过飞机  - 妆上得真好\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}-And to be honest. I'd never even been on an aeroplane before. - Nice make-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.10,0:01:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,直到1969年，空军才教我飞\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Not until the Air Force taught me to fly in 1969.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.47,0:01:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我一共为他们出过28次战斗任务\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I ended up doing 28 Combat missions for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.72,0:01:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,1971年，艰辛的一年\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}In. uh. 1971...Oh. a tough year...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.81,0:01:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我倾尽所有成立了包租航空公司\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I threw everything I owned into a charter serbice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.88,0:01:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你比啤酒广告的青蛙好看  - 我们有一架6座机和一架DC-3\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- you look better than those frog commercial. -we had a six-seater and one DC-3.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.88,0:01:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们哪儿都飞\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}and we would fly anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.64,0:01:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就像空中黄色出租\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}We were like the yellow cabs of the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.57,0:01:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,1979年，我们成立了协力航空公司\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}In 1979. we started Endeavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.13,0:01:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只飞四个不同城市，不过...\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}and we only flew to four different cities. But uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.63,0:01:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,...我想乘客大概感受到 我对飞行的热爱\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I think the passengers picked up on my, my joy in flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们扩展航线 遍及世界上37个国家\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}And we've grown to 37 Countries worldwide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.95,0:01:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们依然是发展中的小公司\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}We're still pretty small in the scheme of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.81,0:02:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,然而，我从未想成为最大的\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}But then. I never wanted to be the biggest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.83,0:02:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,只想最好\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Just the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.33,0:02:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,对我最重要的事情，在今天...\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}The most important thing to me these days...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.63,0:02:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,家人\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.30,0:02:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我的 你的\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Mine. Yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.63,0:02:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这是航空公司带来的好处\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}That's the good thing about an airline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.23,0:02:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,它切实把家人从俗事中联系更紧密\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}It actually brings families closer together among other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.30,0:02:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这让我感觉很棒\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}And that makes me feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.80,0:02:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,1971年，老兄\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}1971. Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.47,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那时我倍感压力\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I had the devil in me back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.60,0:02:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但如今，人们改变了\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}But today...people change.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.77,0:02:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,多少有点吧\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.53,0:02:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他本来真的不想拍\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}He really didn't want to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.50,0:02:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得很棒，他看来很好\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I thought he was great. He was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.03,0:02:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 亚瑟  - 他去哪了？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Author! - Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.74,0:02:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好了，都冲我来吧，你们这群吃白食的\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Okay, get it over with, you pack of freeloaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来吧来吧，我承受得住 - 什么时候播？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Put it there. I got big shoulders. - When's it air?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.12,0:02:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我连问都不敢问\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I was afraid to ask, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.36,0:02:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你们真好心，真是好心\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}No, you're too kind. No, you're too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.80,0:02:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上，它播出之前我就会自杀\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}In fact, I'm contemplating suicide before it airs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.46,0:02:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，因为他太害羞\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Oh, yes, of course. Because he's so shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,下个月，他要上时代广场的内衣看板广告\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}And next month, he's doing the underwear billboard in Times Square.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.46,0:03:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你该看看他的表情\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}You should...You should have seen the look on his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.42,0:03:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他想不出我是从哪里 弄来那些情报的\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}He couldn't figure out where I got that information.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.71,0:03:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 从哪里？  -我在麻省理工修过开锁课 那家伙根本不相信\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- And where did you? - I took safe-cracking at MIT. - No, the guy couldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.52,0:03:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 西恩，你吃过吗？你还好吗？  - 很好\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Hey, Sean, you eat something? You okay? - Yeah. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.30,0:03:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙是疯子，我说真的，他就是...\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}You know, the guy's a wacko. I mean, seriously, he's, like, whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.23,0:03:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,...你可不知道他生意上的所有事情\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}without expecting you to know everything about his business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.85,0:03:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我同意  - 总之，戴维正在考虑\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- I agree. - Yeah. Anyway, uh, David's on the carpet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.34,0:04:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好了，该收帐篷了，伙计们，来吧\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}All right, time to fold the tent, fella. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.50,0:04:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,汤姆？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.07,0:04:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？  - 厨房的瓷砖哪买的？很棒\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Yeah? - Where did you get the tile in the kitchen? It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.60,0:04:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,天，路易莎，那是凯特问题\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Oh, God, Louisa, that's a Kate question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.62,0:04:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧，我只回答汤姆问题，比如…\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}See, I only answer Tom questions like
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.40,0:04:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,“电锯出了什么问题？”\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}you know,what's wrong with my chain saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.22,0:04:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,“杀大灰熊的最佳时机是什么时候？”\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}What's the best time of day to kill a grizzly bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.15,0:04:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个绝佳的汤姆问题\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I have a perfect Tom question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.94,0:04:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,杰基·布朗在监狱牢房里对你提出的民事诉讼，你有何感觉？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}How do you feel about Jackie Brown filing a civil suit against you, from his prison cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.59,0:04:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,西恩，你先去刷牙准备，我马上就来\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Sean, why don't you, uh, brush, get ready. I'll be down in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.37,0:04:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,戴维，请你去找巴布过来\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}David, would you get Bob, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.87,0:04:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你是？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.41,0:04:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是给你提个醒\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I'm just givin' you heads-up
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.59,0:04:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这个叫布朗的 现在说...\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}because this Brown guy now says...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.36,0:04:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他有证据，你付钱请他阻止机械师罢工\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}that he has proof that you paid him to head off the machinists' strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.79,0:04:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这不新奇，他都这么说了好几个月了\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Well, that's not novel. I mean, he's been saying that for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.63,0:04:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道，可他现在说，他有你提供贿赂的证据\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I know, I know. But now he says he has proof that you even initiated the bribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.34,0:04:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我是山米·阿德勒 每日新闻报的\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I'm Sammy Adler from the Daily News.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.05,0:04:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我想也许我们可以花几秒钟…\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I just thought if we could spend a couple seconds...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.72,0:04:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,巴布·斯通、山米·亚当斯，每日新闻报的...\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Oh, oh, Bob Stone, Sammy Adams from the Daily News. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.14,0:05:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-是阿德勒  - 你们何不护送他回家\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Adler. - Why don't you make sure he gets home safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.30,0:05:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你在这里过得愉快，小心开车\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I hope you had a good time here. Drive safely. - All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.58,0:05:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很礼貌的\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}We're very civil here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.38,0:05:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们，我是记者，好吗？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Guys, I'm a reporter, allright?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.08,0:05:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们知道你是谁.  - 我不是狂热跟踪者，伙计们\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}-We know who you are.  -I'm not a stalker, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.44,0:05:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,听着，你们的老板得面对这个\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Listen, your boss is gonna have to deal with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.31,0:05:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,布朗说他被陷害\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Jackie Brown says he was set up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.65,0:05:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该找别人谈\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I think you gotta find someone else to talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.23,0:05:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他是清白的，你明白吗，山米？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}He's in the clear, you understand, Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.61,0:05:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说…\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Listen, if I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.29,0:05:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-我的出身微薄… -停！  -西恩\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- I Came from humble...- Cut. - Sean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.46,0:05:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再来一次…  - 四个城市，但...\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Okay. try it again. -About four Cities. but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,西恩\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Sean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.46,0:05:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜他不在\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Oh, I guess he's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.60,0:05:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我先躺下打个盹，等他来吧\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}So I'll lie down and take a nap while I wait for him to turn up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,床垫凹凸不平\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}God, this mattress is lumpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.22,0:05:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,还有声音，还有头发\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}And damned noisy too. And it's got hair and...what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.97,0:05:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这床垫需要挠挠痒\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}This mattress needs to be tickled!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.98,0:05:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你不准笑\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}No laughing. No laughing allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.19,0:05:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你又看我的出丑镜头干吗？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}And why are you watching my goof-ups again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.74,0:05:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 虫在乱飞，抱歉  - 停！\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}What is this bug in the...Sorry. - Cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.44,0:05:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,很好笑\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.07,0:05:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，一定让你内心暗爽...\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Yeah? Well, must make you feel good inside...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.17,0:05:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,知道你老爸连话都说不好\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}to know your old man can't even talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.63,0:06:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,地球？缩小的地球\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Grobe? A shrinking grobe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.15,0:06:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,楼上那个人在生你的气？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Was that guy mad at you upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.62,0:06:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不，他不是生气。他只是好奇，对\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}No. He's, uh, not mad. He's, uh, he's curious. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.08,0:06:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那是他的工作，你知道的，他有…\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}It's his job, you know. He's gotta...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好像老是有人生你的气\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}It seems like someone's always mad at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来是那样吗？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}That the way that seems?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.79,0:06:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，我想...\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Well, I guess that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.99,0:06:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你没生我的气，对吧？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}You're not mad at me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.51,0:06:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,没\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.47,0:06:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我...我有办法\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Well, I can...I can fix that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.69,0:06:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给我动起来！  - 上车！你他妈闭嘴！\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}-Get your ass movin'! -Get in the car! Shut the fuck up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么也没干\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I ain't do nothin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.27,0:06:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，乔伊…别激动。把他带走\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Hey, hey, hey...Calm down.Joey!Joey! Take it easy. Take.. Get 'im out of here.
