Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.09,0:06:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你这基佬。  - 我是基佬？什么？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}-You little faggot. - Faggot? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.66,0:06:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 算你运气老子没捅你后面  - 嘿…放轻松，没事吧？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- You're lucky I don't put one in your back, you fuck! - Hey, hey, hey. Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吗？你没事吧？  - 我没事，吉米\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- All right? You all right? - I'm all right, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.79,0:06:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的，你最好去送客人\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Honey, you better work the door.
