Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.88,0:06:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你刷过牙了吗？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Okay, did you brush your teeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.09,0:06:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我早上刷过\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I brushed them this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.77,0:07:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不，你现在还得刷\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}No, no, no. We're gonna brush them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.45,0:07:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊，我累垮了\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Oh, God. I'm beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.37,0:07:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙是哪的？每日新闻？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}So where was that guy from? Daily News?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.29,0:07:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,有何不同？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Does it make a difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我要宰了那些混蛋\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Ohh! I'd like to kill those bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.63,0:07:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们骚扰你，就是在骚扰我们\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}When they come after you, they come after us.
