Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.22,0:07:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒想要骚扰那个承包商\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I'd like to come after the contractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.30,0:07:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,对，你得先找到他\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Yeah, well, you gotta find him first.
