Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.30,0:07:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Oh, that feels good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.35,0:07:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,别为那些人生气\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Don't let those guys get to you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.35,0:08:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就想这样\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}That's what they want.
