Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.91,0:08:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,唱歌让我感觉舒畅\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Singin'makes me feel so fine
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,开着卡车，急着赶路\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Drivin'in my truck. man I'm always on the go
