Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.40,0:08:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我介绍 举办这项精彩活动的负责人\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Okay. now I'd like to introduce to you the person responsible for this wonderful event.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.34,0:08:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这位不可思议的女士，是儿童科学展览会的主席\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Uh. a fantastiC lady. In fact. Chairlady of the junior SCienCe Fair...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.64,0:08:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,凯瑟琳·穆伦太太\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Mrs Katherine Mullen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.10,0:08:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.85,0:08:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你，市长\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Thank you, Mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.77,0:08:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎参加纽约市第十届 儿童科学展览会\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}And welcome to the tenth annual New York City Junior Science Fair.
