Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.45,0:08:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 代表22所学校  - 爸，我为何不能参赛？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- representing 22 schools...- Dad? - Yeah? - Why can't I enter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那样不公平，西恩，你母亲是评审\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Well, it wouldn't be fair, Sean. Your mother's a judge here.
