Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.75,0:08:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,干吗不用别的名字参加？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Why don't I enter under a different name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.33,0:08:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么意思？比如约翰·史密斯？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}What, you mean, like John Smith?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.71,0:09:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不，比如X教授\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}No. Like Professor X.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你蒙混不过去，X教授\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Well, I don't think you'd get away with that, Professor X.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.18,0:09:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你太年轻，不可能有职称\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I mean, you're too young to have a degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.22,0:09:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须秃头，戴眼罩，知道吗\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}You got to be bald, have an eye patch. You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.89,0:09:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不，范X教授更好\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}No, better. Professor von X.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.10,0:09:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,第三位评审，请多包涵，就是我本人，凯瑟琳·穆伦\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}And the third judge, I regret to say, is myself, Katherine Mullen...
