Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.05,1:30:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊…\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Oh, God. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.18,1:30:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,南区44号，请说\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}South 44. go.
