Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.65,1:33:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,凯特？汤姆？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Kate. Tom.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.33,1:33:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,FBI，让开，让开\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}FBI. Comin' through. Comin' through.
