Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.75,1:34:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我能带走他吗？能抱他吗？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Can I pick him up? Can I hold him?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.44,1:34:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他没事的  - 哦，西恩\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Oh, he's gonna be all right. - Oh, Sean.
