Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.24,1:37:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,一个家伙开始冲我开火\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}one guy starts blastin' away at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.40,1:37:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,另一个人，他开车来撞我\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}The...The other guy, he goes to run me over.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.30,1:37:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,所以，你知道，我干了必须干的事\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}So, you know, I just did what I had to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.93,1:37:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那个女人呢？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}What about the woman?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.79,1:37:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Jimmy?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.19,1:37:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,喔，你知道，我被子弹打得转过身\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Uh, you know, I just, uh, got spun around by the bullet.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.77,1:37:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道那是个女人，后来才知\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I didn't know it was a woman 'til after.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.02,1:37:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个诚实的警察，他工作极其出色\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}He's a. an honest Cop. He does a hell of a job.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.99,1:37:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不，只要一张，取消另一张\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}No, just one. Cancel the other one.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.12,1:37:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我要跟他一起\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}That's why I wanna with him
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.85,1:37:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我什么感觉？我跟你说，这是第二次，吉米·谢克中枪 …- 不，只要单程\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- How do I feel? I'll tell ya. this is the second time Jimmy Shaker's been shot. -Just one-way.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.88,1:37:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,一次是1992年前，有个人不停还击...\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}One's before 1992, this guy keeps shooting back...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.05,1:37:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,对，肯尼先生，对，谢谢\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Yeah. Uh, Mr Kinney. Yeah. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.18,1:37:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,继续我们对穆伦绑票案的报道...\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Continuing our coverage of the Mullen kidnapping case...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.58,1:37:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,围绕玛莉斯·康纳仍有很多疑问\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}questions still surround Maris Conner.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.04,1:38:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,由于没有前科，当局正在询问其亲朋好友...\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}With no prior criminal record, authorities are interrogating family and friends...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.22,1:38:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,查找她与其他已死嫌犯的任何关联\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}seeking any associations that would connect her to the other slain suspects.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.86,1:38:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,消息来源今天透露，调查仍在继续...\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Sources reveal today that the investigation continues...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.74,1:38:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,而且对其他嫌犯的搜索绝没有结束\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}and the search for other suspects is by no means over.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.49,1:38:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,许多调查人员相信\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Many investigators believe.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.59,1:38:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上穆伦绑票案的主谋可能仍然在逃\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}that, indeed, the mastermind of the Mullen kidnapping... may still be at large.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.46,1:38:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以办到\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}We can make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.96,1:38:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你冷吗，宝贝？ - 对，我的双手\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- You cold, honey? - Yeah. My hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.44,1:38:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想回家吗？ - 我没带着手套，不想…\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Do you wanna go home? - I didn't bring my gloves.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.56,1:38:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不不  - 你确定？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}-No. No. No. -You sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.63,1:38:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你有点眯眼睛，阳光还是刺眼吗？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Hey, you're squinting a little. Is the sun still bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.34,1:38:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 戴上这个 - 对\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Put these on. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.80,1:38:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我去给你拿手套  - 好\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- I'll go get your gloves. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.93,1:38:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你要练习，我就回来\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}You'd better practise. I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.24,1:38:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我，你戴眼镜好帅，宝贝\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Look at me. You look good in those, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.55,1:38:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我的眼镜，能看到吗？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Look at my glasses. Can you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.95,1:38:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,戴着它像是你爸爸\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Look like your daddy in those.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.94,1:38:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,戴维，现在我有点不能专注，能等等吗？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Well, David, it's a little hard to focus right now. Can it wait?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.15,1:38:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不行？管他的，那就让他去吧，算了\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}No? Well, the hell with it, then. Let him have it. Let it go.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.95,1:39:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,对，听着，西恩在公园等我，也许我们…\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Yeah. Listen, I got Sean waitin' for me in the park, so maybe we...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.24,1:39:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿…  - 嘿…\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Hey. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.95,1:39:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我回头打给你，戴维，回头打给你\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Uh, I'll call you back, David. Call you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.08,1:39:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,穆伦先生\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Mr Mullen. .
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.22,1:39:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,门房刚呼叫，说谢克先生想见你\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}The doorman just called up, Mr Shaker wants to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.82,1:39:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,对对，我很抱歉就这么出现了\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Yeah, yeah, I'm sorry to show up like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.84,1:39:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，完全不用，进来，我想跟你聊聊\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Oh, hell, no. Come in. I-I wanna talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.83,1:39:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.96,1:39:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,进来进来，肩伤如何？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Come in. Come in. How's the shoulder?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.16,1:39:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,还好，我死不了的\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Ahh, you know. I'll live.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.05,1:39:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我很惊讶这么就见到你\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Yeah. Well, I'm surprised to see you up and about so quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.96,1:39:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,呃，法蒂玛，这是吉米·谢克\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Uh, uh, Fatima, this is, uh,Jimmy Shaker.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.65,1:39:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我真骄傲能见到你，真以你为傲\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I'm very proud to meet you. Very proud.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.27,1:39:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.40,1:39:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那个...孩子好吗？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}How's the, uh, kid doin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.69,1:39:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他很好，你知道\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Oh, he's fine, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.86,1:39:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 经历了这么多，需要点时间  - 是啊\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- all things considered. It'll take a while. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.03,1:39:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，请原谅我\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Um, uh, forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.37,1:39:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我们要在周一见，也许是我搞错了，我不...\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I, uh, I thought we were gonna meet on Monday. M-Maybe I screwed up. I don't...I...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.08,1:39:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,喔，对的，你是对的，周一，我们…我们是这么说定的\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Uh, yeah, uh, you're right. Monday. We...That's what we said, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.28,1:39:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,呼叫特派警员4-5-9...\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}See the special officer holding 4-5-9...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.25,1:39:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧，我不想你对我有什么错误的印象...\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Look, I don't want you to get the wrong impression of me here...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.92,1:40:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我希望我们能今天办这事\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}but I was hopin' we could do this today.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.85,1:40:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你知道，奖金的事  - 当然...\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- You know, the reward and all? - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.27,1:40:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,因为，我得跟你说\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}'Cause I gotta tell ya it's
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.77,1:40:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我被缠得差不多疯了，你知道，压力啊乱七八糟的\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}'uh, kinda crazy around me, you know, with the, the press and everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.43,1:40:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，我了解，瞧，他们都是疯子\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Oh, I understand. Yeah. Look, they're maniacs.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.33,1:40:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是啊  - 啥都不容易，跟我来\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Yeah. - Nothin' easier. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.15,1:40:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我不习惯这个，你知道，我只是...我得离开这儿\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I'm not used to this, you know. I...I just gotta get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.70,1:40:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我算是个...安静的人，你要知道\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Kind of a private person, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.41,1:40:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你说实话，我以前从没杀过人\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}To tell you the truth, I never killed anybody before.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.51,1:40:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这段时间很难受\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Havin' a hard time with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.22,1:40:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，那个，我很遗憾\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Yeah, well, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.12,1:40:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我很高兴你所做的事情\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Uh, I'm glad you did what you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.05,1:40:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不过很遗憾\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}But I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.22,1:40:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,请坐吧\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Sit down, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.18,1:40:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.81,1:40:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,呃，那么是...吉米？还是詹姆斯？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Uh, so, is it, uh...is it Jimmy? James?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.19,1:40:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}James.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.52,1:40:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯就行了\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}James'll do.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.02,1:41:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,（4百万美元）
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.75,1:41:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我能问你一个私人问题吗？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Can I ask you a personal question?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.75,1:41:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.75,1:41:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你为何不付赎金？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Why didn't you pay the ransom?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.93,1:41:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我是在跟人渣垃圾打交道\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Well, because I was dealing with human garbage.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.43,1:41:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,约定不会被遵守，他们不会\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}No contract would have been honoured, not by them.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.77,1:41:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道，好玩的是\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}You know, the funny thing is,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.68,1:41:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿意付10倍赎金，只要我感觉他们会遵守交易\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I would have paid ten times as much...if I had any sense that they'd stick to the deal,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.72,1:41:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但...没有\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}but no.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.06,1:41:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？  - 哦，真的\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Really. - Oh, yeah. Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.73,1:41:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,真正让我痛心的是那个女人\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}The thing that really kills me about that is the woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.53,1:41:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,去年她来过这房子五、六次，人很好\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}She'd been in this house five, six times over the last year. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.33,1:41:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但是，你知道，你就是不能...\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}But, you know. You just can't, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.43,1:41:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道人怎么能就这么在你周围，同时...\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I-I don't know how people can walk around with that...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.43,1:41:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,又那么冷血，双面...那么贱\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}That cold-blooded, two-faced...That bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.58,1:42:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道，出于对死者公平...\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Well, uh, you know, in fairness to the dead...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.98,1:42:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,如今，在这年纪，我们都有点两面性\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}we're all a little two-faced in this day and age.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.76,1:42:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一种幸存机制，你明白我说的吗？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}It's a survival mechanism. You kn...You know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.82,1:42:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说...\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I mean
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.12,1:42:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道，我当警察的\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}you know, as a cop...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.32,1:42:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该听听那些我多年来一直在听的东西\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}you should hear some of the stuff that's been thrown my way over the years.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.78,1:42:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,汤姆，别拿手套了，他想回家\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Tom, just forget about the gloves, honey. He wanted to come home.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.90,1:42:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,凯特，谢克先生来了\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Kate, uh...Mr Shaker's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.07,1:42:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,谢克先生\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Mr Shaker.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.67,1:42:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝保佑你，谢谢你\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}God bless you. Uh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.22,1:42:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,别客气\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.29,1:42:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,听着，你得见见西恩，我去带他来\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Listen, you...you gotta meet Sean. I'll go get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.72,1:43:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不，他，经历够痛苦了，咱们让他缓缓吧\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}No, uh, he's, you know, had enough. Let's give him a breather. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.06,1:43:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没错，他是受够了\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Yeah, yeah. He's-He's had enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.11,1:43:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧，我能为你做点什么？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Okay. Uh, can I get you anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.61,1:43:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不用，我很好\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.20,1:43:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我，我不知该如何...  - 我了解，不用挂心\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}-Oh, well, again, I...I can't even begin to... -I understand. Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.25,1:43:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,法蒂玛，你能下楼来帮帮我吗？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Fatima, would you please help me with some things downstairs?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.88,1:43:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上就来\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.14,1:43:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这个，你这可是一大笔存款呀\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Well, this is, uh, one hell of a deposit you've got here.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.81,1:43:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那应该不成问题的\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Shouldn't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.11,1:43:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你大概想走了\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Well, you'll probably wanna be on your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.07,1:43:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我还能帮你什么忙吗？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Uh, unless there's anything else I can do for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.31,1:44:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.92,1:44:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,对，我知道外面那些秃鹫会把你逼疯\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Right. Well, I know how these vultures out there can drive ya nuts, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.67,1:44:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这里有后门，如果你想有点…  - 这张支票是废纸，汤姆\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}You know, there's a back door out if you, you know, wanna be a little more s...This check is bullshit, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.42,1:44:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么打算的？我就这么出去了，你他妈的大骗子\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}What'd you think, I'm just gonna waltz outta here, you lying motherfucker? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.10,1:44:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,让你打电话报警\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Let you make a phone call,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.59,1:44:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,纽约的一半警察等着我去兑现金？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}have half the cops in New York waitin' for me while I cash this thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.45,1:44:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你别想耍我\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}You can't lie to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.10,1:44:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听着…  - 给我闭嘴\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Look...- Shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.63,1:44:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,c----ao 操！\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.74,1:44:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁，给我坐下\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}You know who I am. Now you sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.08,1:44:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,大家本来会好好的\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Everybody was gonna make out fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.79,1:44:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,可你非得较这个劲\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}But you had to go and put it together...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.92,1:44:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,所以现在我们有点小问题了，不是吗？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}and now we got a little problem here, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.22,1:45:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,再跟我说说这个，你为何不付赎金？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Tell me that part again about why you didn't pay the ransom.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.26,1:45:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们还有办法…\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I think we can do something here...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.26,1:45:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,说啊，你是跟什么打交道？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Say it! You were dealing with what?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.52,1:45:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你绑走我儿子\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}You had my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.60,1:45:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本就不懂什么是人渣垃圾，妈了个逼\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}You have no idea what human garbage is, motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.94,1:45:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你他妈说的是什么吗？不，你不知道\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Do you know what the fuck you're talking about? No, I don't think you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.57,1:45:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你他妈住的地方\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}'Cause look where you fuckin' live, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.03,1:45:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,航空业大亨，却他妈不肯付一分钱，去救唯一的孩子\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Look at the airline man here. This fucker won't pay one cent to save his only kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.66,1:45:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,付钱就不回他来，对吧？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}It wasn't gonna get him back, was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.08,1:45:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，你读过报纸吗？你看过电视吗？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Hey, did you read the papers? Huh? Did you see the TV?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.14,1:45:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我挨了一颗子弹，我冒生命危险救你儿子\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I took a bullet. I risked my life to save your kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.59,1:45:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我挨了一颗子弹，现在你又想在钱上整我？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I took a bullet, and now you're gonna try to fuck me out of my money. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.28,1:45:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这里有什么？ - 你要上哪去？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- What's over here? - Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.22,1:45:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈妈和孩子呢？ - 我现在付，现在\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Where's Mommy and Junior? - Now I'll pay. Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.39,1:45:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，是啊，你要付出代价，现在\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Oh, yeah. You're gonna pay, all right. Right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.00,1:45:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你有银行户头 可以让我汇钱进去吧？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Do you have an account I can wire the money to?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.60,1:45:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说，这些你一定全都安排好了，对吧？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I mean, you got to have been all set up for this, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.52,1:45:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说，你并不笨\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I mean, you're not dumb.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.85,1:45:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟我，我们现在到我的银行去\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}You and me, we go right now to my bank...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.86,1:46:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,把钱从我的账户转到你的，只要按一个按钮，仅仅如此\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}and we wire the money from my account to yours. Just the push of a button. Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.69,1:46:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只要到银行去，就能办妥\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}We'll just go down to the bank and get it done.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.20,1:46:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,拿起电话，从这里汇钱\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Pick up the phone. Wire it from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.41,1:46:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不行，我们到银行汇\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Uh, no, we'll go to the bank and do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.63,1:46:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你会拿到钱，我要的回报，只是你现在离开这所房子\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}And you'll get the money and all I want in return is you out of this house now.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.51,1:46:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，轮不到你作主\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Hey. You do not call the shots.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.93,1:46:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那你来吧，此时此刻就杀了我，狗娘养的\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Well, then, you just go ahead and kill me right here and now, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.97,1:46:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈的，去你的，我不会拿起电话\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}You fuck! Fuck you! I'm not pickin' up that phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.92,1:46:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,听到了吗？我不拿电话\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}You got that? I'm not pickin' it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.56,1:46:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧，你可以杀了我，来，杀了我，杀了我们\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Look, uh, you can kill me. Go ahead. Kill me. Just kill us.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.30,1:46:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,留我们活命，无关紧要，不管你怎么选都得跑路\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Let us live. Doesn't matter. Any way you cut it, you're on the run.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.00,1:46:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以跟我去银行，带着4百万跑路\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Now, you can come with me to the bank and be on the run with $4 million...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.51,1:46:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,要么你现在开枪，带着你钱包里那点东西跑路\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}or you can just start shootin' and be on the run with whatever you got in your wallet.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.14,1:46:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,全看你\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.33,1:46:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托，吉米 我们去银行吧  天啊…\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Come on,Jimmy. Let's go to the bank. Oh,Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.96,1:47:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我如愿以偿\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I got what I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.38,1:47:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,底线就是：我救回我儿子\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Bottom line: I got my son back.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.73,1:47:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你把他送回来了\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}And you d...you delivered him.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.22,1:47:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我有私人飞机，我本人可以带你飞到任何想去的地方\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I got my own plane. I can fly you out of here myself anywhere you wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.51,1:47:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是能赢的\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}You can still win this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.06,1:47:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,想想，你还是能赢\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Think. You can still win.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.66,1:47:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们照你说的做，我们去银行\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}We do what you say. We go to the bank.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.54,1:47:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,如果出差错，你要反水，我会逃得很快\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}If anything goes wrong, you're gonna turn around and I'll be gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.83,1:47:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,果真如此\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Okay? And if that happens...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.29,1:47:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,从今天起\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}from this day on...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.67,1:47:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,任何时候你儿子离开这房子去上学...\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}any time your kid leaves this house to go to school...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.15,1:47:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,去玩，找朋友，去买他妈的漫画 你都得自问…\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}go play, see a friend... to buy a fuckin' comic book, you're gonna have to ask yourself:
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.81,1:48:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,今天...吉米·谢克会来吗？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Is today... Jimmy Shaker day?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.36,1:48:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我逮过他一次\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I got to him once.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.08,1:48:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我还能再逮到他\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I'll get him again.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.82,1:48:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,下次逮到他\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}And when I do...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.90,1:48:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会再要钱了\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I'm not gonna want money any more.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.50,1:48:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们互相清楚了吗？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Do we understand each other?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.20,1:48:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.06,1:48:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这是为玛莉斯\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}That's from Maris.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.44,1:48:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,打电话给机场\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Call the airport.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.43,1:48:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去哪？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Where are we goin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.62,1:49:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,墨西哥，瓜达拉哈纳\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Mexico. Guadalajara.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.64,1:49:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,戴维，这是汤姆\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}David, this is Tom.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.96,1:49:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机加油 我要去瓜达拉哈纳\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Uh, fuel up the jet. I'm going to Guadalajara.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.21,1:49:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,对，突然有事，我正要去银行\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Yeah, well, something came up. I'm on my way to the bank now.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.63,1:49:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,“免持听筒”
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.04,1:49:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,绑匪和你在一起吗？ 没错\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Is the kidnapper with you? - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.22,1:49:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,以后再解释，给凯特打个电话，再见\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I'll explain everything later. Give Katie a call. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.69,1:49:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,安东，帮我接穆伦家\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Antone, get me the Mullen house.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.48,1:49:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,西恩，怎么了，宝贝？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Sean, what's the matter, honey?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.28,1:49:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.32,1:49:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,出租车，出租车\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Taxi. Taxi.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.61,1:49:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,走在我右边\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Stay on my right.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.79,1:49:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你们干嘛？不能在这里停车\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}What are you guys doin'? You can't park there.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.92,1:49:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我只进银行去，五分钟\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Oh, we're just goin' to the bank. Five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.19,1:49:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,谢克？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Shaker?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.42,1:49:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.44,1:49:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你好吗，吉米？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}How you doin',Jimmy?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.84,1:50:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好吗？ - 幸会\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- How are ya?- Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.70,1:50:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是啊，幸会， - 你好吗，穆伦先生？幸会\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Yeah? You too. - How you doin', Mr Mullen? Good to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.91,1:50:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,只是想跟你握握手，老大，你给我们增光\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Just wanna shake your hand, boss. You made us proud.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.60,1:50:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我只是尽职而已  - 是啊\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Well, you know, just doin' the job. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.35,1:50:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得他如何？穆伦先生\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}What do you think of this guy, Mr Mullen?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.56,1:50:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我还能说什么？他是条汉子  - 是啊\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Well, what can I say? He's the man. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.98,1:50:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好了各位，别激动\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Okay, guys, uh, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.29,1:50:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 以后见，吉米  - 好\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Later, Jimbo. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.81,1:50:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们别太激动  - 好好\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- You guys take it easy now. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.81,1:50:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不会太久吧？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}You guys not gonna be long, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.28,1:50:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只是五分钟  - 没事，没问题\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- No, just five minutes. - No, no, no. - No problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.58,1:50:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,穆伦先生，荣幸加惊喜，欢迎\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Mr Mullen, what a pleasant surprise. Wellcome!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.13,1:50:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这银行还有钱吧？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Uh, have I still got any money in this bank?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.18,1:50:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我和谢克先生有点业务要办，这位是迈克尔\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I have to do some business with Mr Shaker here. This is Michael.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.21,1:50:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,谢克先生，当然，这边请\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Mr Shaker, of course. Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.64,1:50:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Terrific.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.64,1:50:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好，够了，我们把钱给他吧\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Okay, that's enough. Let's get this man his money.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.57,1:50:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢了\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Thanks very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.49,1:50:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}No, not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.88,1:51:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,22各单位，寻找警探吉米·谢克\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}All units in the 22. looking for Detective James Shaker...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.20,1:51:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,白人男子，四十一岁 身着黑色外套，白衬衣\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}white male. 41 years. wearing blaCk jacket. white shirt.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.61,1:51:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,谢克据认为在麦迪逊和90街附近\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Shaker is thought to be in the vicinity of Madison and 90th Street.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.29,1:51:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,嫌犯是一名武装的纽约市警探…\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Subject is an armed New York City detective.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.37,1:51:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,只要按下“输入”键，就是你的了\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Just push enter and it's yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.00,1:51:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,四百万\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Four million.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.42,1:51:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,“转帐金额，四百万元” “转帐已完成”
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.88,1:51:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜你\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.68,1:51:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.80,1:51:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.90,1:51:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，谢克\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Hey, Shaker.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.90,1:51:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？ 我刚听到无线电通报\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}What's goin' on? I just got a call over the radio.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.53,1:51:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，嘿，今天我生日，你知道，伙计们想拿我开涮\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Oh, hey, hey, it's my birthday. You know, the guys are tryin' to pull something.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.85,1:51:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我，我没事的\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}I-I got it covered.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.32,1:51:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能跟你谈谈吗？\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Can we talk to you for a second, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.78,1:51:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我们得拘捕你\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}No, we have to detain you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.00,1:51:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,谢克，别动！\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Shaker! Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.73,1:52:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，他在这儿！\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Hey, he's over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.69,1:53:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,放下，放下\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Put it down! Put it down!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.65,1:53:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Put the gun down!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.19,1:53:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Put the gun down!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.57,1:53:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,汤姆，是我，朗尼\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Hold your fire! Tom, it's me, Lonnie.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.53,1:53:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,FBI！别开枪！结束了，谢克，结束了！\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}F.B.I.! F.B.I.! Hold your fire!  It's over, Shaker. Over!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.12,1:53:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,扔掉\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Drop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.04,1:54:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,把枪放下，汤姆，放下枪\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Put the gun down, Tom. Put the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.13,1:54:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不！  - 走开！\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- No! - Step away!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.79,1:54:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 扔掉，扔掉  - 把枪放下，汤姆，然后走开\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Drop it now! Drop it now! - Put the gun down, Tom, and walk away.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.71,1:54:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,穆伦，放下该死的枪！\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Mullen, put the god damn gun down
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.57,1:54:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放下，穆伦，立刻！ - 来吧，放下枪\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Down, Mullen! Now! - Come on. Come on. Put the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.85,1:54:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 扔掉枪！  - 来吧，往我这走\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Drop the gun! - Come on. Walk toward me.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.22,1:54:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,汤姆，别干傻事\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Tom, don't do nothin' stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.55,1:54:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把枪放下，汤姆  - 扔掉它！\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}- Put the gun down, Tom! - Drop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.28,1:54:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,趴在地上，谢克\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}On the ground, Shaker!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.27,1:54:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,趴在地上\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}On the ground!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.33,1:54:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,汤姆，立刻放下枪\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Tom, put the gun down now!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.13,1:54:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 趴下！ - 待在那！别动！\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Down! Stay right there! Now, don't move!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.53,1:54:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Put the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.83,1:54:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,没错，现在退后，汤姆，走开吧\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}That's right. Now, back off, Tom. Just walk away.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.73,1:55:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,转身对墙！快！伸展四肢！\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Get up against the wall! Move! Spread 'em!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.14,1:55:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,汤姆·穆伦是跟我们一起的！\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Tom Mullen is with us!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:20.37,1:55:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 退后！  - 不！不！\N{\fs10\1c&HB4DCFC&}Back away! -No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.75,1:56:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,卡司大家都知道，梅尔·吉布森，蕾妮·罗素 搭档过《轰天炮》系列
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.05,1:56:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜老梅尔，好演员好导演 得罪了好莱坞犹太权贵 星光黯淡

